Subject: [PATCH 123/202] [ae-patch] Predict the next prompt after each Claude
 turn and show it as ghost text in the composer

On a parent session's Stop hook the claude-native forwarder starts one
background side call, claude -p --model haiku, with the turn's last prompt
and last reply, isolated from hooks, settings, MCP servers, tools and session
persistence. Its one-line answer is posted as the transient
external_session_suggestion event, relayed as session.suggestion, and the
web composer draws it as grey ghost text over the empty box: Tab or a tap
fills it in without sending. Off unless AE_PROMPT_SUGGESTIONS=1.
